# Async and cancellation

Pass the request cancellation token from gRPC or GraphQL through the mediator into EF and downstream service calls.

Use `async` and `await` throughout asynchronous call chains, including forwarding methods. Pass the token to database, network and stream operations. Keep in-memory calculations synchronous.
